摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 破甲：默认提示词面向国模「鸢码」，完整开放版，无付费墙，技能库与知识库全含。破解市面上收费 388u 的版本，免费公开。Jailbreak for every model — swap prompts per model. 求 Star 收藏 ⭐","id":"gh:1449581967","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-purge-safe","slug":"CallMeGuLab/dsh-purge-safe","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","harness-jailbreak","jailbreak","llm-jailbreak","prompt-injection","red-team"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 破甲：默认提示词面向国模「鸢码」，完整开放版，无付费墙，技能库与知识库全含。破解市面上收费 388u 的版本，免费公开。Jailbreak for every mod"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"el — swap prompts per model. 求 Star 收藏 ⭐"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"⚔️ DeepSeek Harness cybersecurity red-team tool (dsh-purge-safe)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Version 0.1.0"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness jailbreak: every model, swap prompts per model. Default prompt for 鸢码. Please star "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"⭐ If you build on this, see Attribution required."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | 中文 | 日本語"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- What this is\n- Attribution required\n- License\n- Supported hosts\n- Install\n- Usage\n- How it works\n-"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"tribution required\n- License\n- Supported hosts\n- Install\n- Usage\n- How it works\n- Restore\n- Releases"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What this is"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**dsh-purge-safe** is a cybersecurity red-team plugin for the official DeepSeek Harness already inst"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"alled on your machine. **0.1.0** targets **DSH 0.2.1-rc.5** (rc.2 still works). Official **Web** (`d"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"sh web`) and the official **desktop EXE** are both supported. Install and Apply them separately."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Harness does more than forward a prompt. It rewrites prompts, approval gates, sandbox policy, and se"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ssion migration at runtime. Asking only “will the model answer” treats a host-layer block as a model"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" refusal. This plugin separates those two layers on your own install, for controlled evaluation and "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"for seeing which default policy is too tight."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| You get | What it does |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **dsh-purge-safe dock** | A button beside the session title opens the right dock. Two pages: Clean"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" and Drill |\n| **Clean** | Grouped patch status, Apply / Restore / Uninstall, prompt editor, multipl"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"e rule sets |\n| **Drill** | Built into the stable release. After authorization: assets and the local"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" environment. The skill library and knowledge base ship with it. |\n| **Host policy** | Default copy,"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" permission policy, and tool limits. Official capabilities stay. No second invented identity |\n| **O"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"n start** | Checks and reapplies. After npm overwrites `node_modules`, you do not hand-edit files |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"No hardcoded drive letters. It looks at `$DSH_HOME`, `.dsh` next to the dsh launcher, then `~/.dsh`."},{"id":"p13s2","text":" It does not patch the Harness source tree. **Apply** on the **Clean** page of **dsh-purge-safe** is"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" what writes the changes. Identity comes from the encrypted prompt shipped in the plugin, the text t"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"he prompt box shows by default. The host prompt file is not read."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"It only touches the official `@deepseek-ai` packages and local config on the user's machine. It is n"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ot a public scanner and not an attack kit for third-party sites. The repo does not ship malware, una"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"uthorized-exploit scripts, or payloads aimed at the public internet."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Resale of the original is prohibited. Forks must attribute."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Attribution required"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Resale of the original build is prohibited.** Paid resale, re-skinning for store listings, and dis"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"tribution as a commercial product are not permitted."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Forks must attribute** and name the source repository: CallMeGuLab/dsh-purge-safe. Same if you bor"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"row the name, ideas, code, or prompts."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Removing attribution, concealing the source, or reselling the original will be pursued by the mainta"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ng attribution, concealing the source, or reselling the original will be pursued by the maintainers."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"This repo is Apache License 2.0. Forks and redistributions must keep the copyright notice and NOTICE"},{"id":"p21s2","text":", and name CallMeGuLab/dsh-purge-safe. Resale of the original is prohibited."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### ⚠️ <font color=\"red\">Strict legal and compliance disclaimer</font>"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"<font color=\"red\">"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Disclaimer:** This is a non-profit open-source project. It follows applicable laws and the rules o"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"f the platforms it uses, and is intended only for learning and research. Do not use it for any illeg"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"al or non-compliant purpose; the user bears any resulting consequences."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Zero-tolerance statement:** This project opposes and forbids any illegal activity. The maintainers"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" do not support, encourage, or assist unauthorized network attacks, exploit use, data theft, unlawfu"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"l intrusion into computer information systems, or generation of illegal or prohibited content. **Any"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"one who uses this project for crime is solely responsible under the law. The maintainers have no lia"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"ses this project for crime is solely responsible under the law. The maintainers have no liability.**"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"1. **This repository contains no illegal material.** The published code, docs, patches, and default "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"prompt are **not** malware, backdoors, unauthorized pentest kits, ransomware, credential-stuffing sc"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ripts, or attack payloads aimed at the public internet or third-party systems. The project does not "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"supply illegal content and does not incite, organize, or assist crime.\n2. **Local official Harness o"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"nly.** Security-eval patches and prompt injection run only on the **official DeepSeek Harness alread"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"y installed on the user's machine** (`@deepseek-ai` packages, local profile / `$DSH_HOME`). The targ"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"et is the user's own official local software, **not** someone else's website, server, account, or in"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"formation system.\n3. **Eval patches do not attack the public internet.** Apply, inject, revert, and "},{"id":"p26s9","text":"uninstall stay in local files and local processes. They **do not scan, probe, intrude, or send attac"},{"id":"p26s10","text":"k traffic to any public host or unauthorized system**. Do not use this project as a jump host agains"},{"id":"p26s11","text":"t the public internet. If \"check for updates\" is on, the plugin may only contact this plugin's own G"},{"id":"p26s12","text":"itHub repository to compare versions. That is **not** an attack on third-party systems and is **not*"},{"id":"p26s13","text":"* authorization to penetrate anything.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Supported hosts"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**0.1.0 targets DSH 0.2.1-rc.5.** 0.2.1-rc.2 still works."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- **dsh 0.2.1-rc.5** (official desktop / official `dsh web`): recommended. Fixes `{{cwd}}` / `[cwd]`"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" crash, patch #40 match, dropped `toolFilter`, host `dsh-tools` resolve, hostFs fd, desktop helper s"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"elf-kill, `file:` archive update, Ctrl+Enter steer.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Apply, on start or when you click Apply:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Override on each session:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Prompt injection and ruleset decision at every turn. The three inputs on the left are what you contr"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ol in the dsh-purge-safe panel; the dotted edges show which decision each one drives:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
